If you turn on your XP showing, you can get details on how close you are to
leveling. Level 2 is at 20 xp. Some of the weaker monsters in the upper
levels, like grid bugs, jackals, kobolds, kobold zombies are only worth 1
XP each, so you can slaughter a fair number of them when you pet isn't
around without grave risk. Things like lichens and foxes are worth 4 xp, so
not so much of that.

What really helps is finding a magic whistle or a leash very early on, but
you can't count on that at all, so just have to work hard to keep your pet
in your vicinity.


